  "details": "I have VR equipment, but the controller broke the other day. I am playing with a game controller. However, with the keyboard assignment I noticed that I could not assign a key using the controller to which the head mounted display was connected. I want to assign an animation to an unnecessary controller button, but I could not assign it. This is because the VR device does not respond to the F1 - F8 keys while holding down the Shift key during execution. We recommend adding key assignments to the system.",
